      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "A supporting action beside a primary workflow action.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-secondary\">Define criteria in Codex</button>",
      "css": ".ds-secondary{font:14px/20px var(--intgral-font-sans);border-radius:var(--intgral-radius-control);cursor:pointer;min-height:40px;padding:7px 12px;border:0;background:var(--intgral-surface-raised);color:var(--intgral-foreground);transition:background var(--intgral-duration-feedback),color var(--intgral-duration-feedback)}.ds-secondary:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--intgral-selection)}.ds-secondary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--intgral-focus);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-secondary:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.5}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-secondary{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Project selector",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "project-select",
      "description": "A native selector preserves keyboard behavior and grouped example/saved project choices. Its Project label remains available to assistive technology.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-picker\"><span class=\"ds-sr-only\">Project</span><select class=\"ds-select\"><option>Choose a project</option><optgroup label=\"Examples\"><option>Inspection rig · example</option></optgroup><optgroup label=\"Saved projects\"><option>Bench fixture · r3</option></optgroup></select></label>",
      "css": ".ds-picker{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font:12px/18px var(--intgral-font-sans);color:var(--intgral-foreground-muted)}.ds-select{height:40px;width:240px;max-width:100%;min-width:0;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid var(--intgral-control-border);border-radius:var(--intgral-radius-control);font:14px/20px var(--intgral-font-sans);background:var(--intgral-surface-raised);color:var(--intgral-foreground)}.ds-select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--intgral-focus);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip-path:inset(50%);white-space:nowrap}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Source intake field",
      "kind": "input",
      "description": "The existing source dialog field treatment is local to intake; its legacy fill/border are not shared Silence tokens.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-intake-label\">Project name<input class=\"ds-intake-field\" placeholder=\"Bench inspection fixture\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-intake-label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;margin:0 0 16px;font:12px/20px var(--intgral-font-sans);color:var(--intgral-foreground)}.ds-intake-field{width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #d8d9cf;border-radius:6px;background:#fffefa;color:var(--intgral-foreground);font:12px/18px var(--intgral-font-sans)}.ds-intake-field:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--intgral-focus);outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Inspector tabs",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "inspector-tab",
      "description": "Details, Reference and Checks share one selection scope; the app implements roving focus and arrow/Home/End navigation.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Part inspection\"><button class=\"ds-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Details</button><button class=\"ds-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">Reference</button><button class=\"ds-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Checks</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs{display:flex;gap:24px;padding:0 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--intgral-border)}.ds-tab{min-height:44px;padding:8px 0;border:0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;border-radius:0;background:transparent;color:var(--intgral-foreground-muted);font:14px/20px var(--intgral-font-sans);cursor:pointer}.ds-tab[aria-selected=\"true\"]{color:var(--intgral-foreground);border-bottom-color:var(--intgral-foreground)}.ds-tab:hover{background:var(--intgral-selection)}.ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--intgral-focus);outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Current check outcome",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "outcome-pass",
      "description": "Written outcome plus counts for a current scope-bound report; semantic colors accompany text.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-check-summary\"><span class=\"ds-outcome\" data-outcome=\"pass\">pass</span><span>3 passed · 2 unchecked</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-check-summary{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:12px 0;font:12px/20px var(--intgral-font-sans);color:var(--intgral-foreground-muted)}.ds-outcome{padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--intgral-selection);color:var(--intgral-foreground)}.ds-outcome[data-outcome=\"pass\"]{background:var(--intgral-success-soft);color:var(--intgral-success)}.ds-outcome[data-outcome=\"fail\"]{background:var(--intgral-destructive-soft);color:var(--intgral-destructive)}.ds-outcome[data-outcome=\"blocked\"]{background:var(--intgral-warning-soft);color:var(--intgral-warning)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Floating inspector panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "floating-panel",
      "description": "Selection opens the inspector. At narrow widths it floats above the model; opening it closes structure.",
      "html": "<aside class=\"ds-panel\" aria-label=\"Reference and selection\"><div class=\"ds-panel-header\"><span>Selected part</span><button class=\"ds-panel-close\" aria-label=\"Close inspector\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 6 12 12M18 6 6 18\"/></svg></button></div><section class=\"ds-panel-body\"><p>Reference and checks remain scoped to this occurrence.</p></section></aside>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{width:min(340px,calc(100% - 32px));overflow-y:auto;border-radius:var(--intgral-radius-floating);background:var(--intgral-background);color:var(--intgral-foreground);box-shadow:var(--intgral-shadow-floating);font:14px/20px var(--intgral-font-sans)}.ds-panel-header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--intgral-border);font-weight:500}.ds-panel-close{min-width:32px;min-height:32px;padding:6px;border:0;border-radius:var(--intgral-radius-control);background:transparent;color:inherit;cursor:pointer}.ds-panel-close:hover{background:var(--intgral-selection)}.ds-panel-close:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--intgral-focus);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-panel-body{padding:24px 20px}.ds-panel-body h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;font-weight:500}.ds-panel-body p{color:var(--intgral-foreground-secondary);font-size:14px;line-height:22px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Workflow step",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Completed steps show an inline SVG check; current and upcoming steps keep their centered sequence number.",
      "html": "<ol class=\"ds-phases\" aria-label=\"Object to CAD workflow\"><li class=\"ds-step\" data-state=\"complete\"><span class=\"ds-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg></span><span>Source</span></li><li class=\"ds-step\" data-state=\"current\" aria-current=\"step\"><span class=\"ds-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span>Proposal</span></li><li class=\"ds-step\" data-state=\"upcoming\"><span class=\"ds-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span>Decompose</span></li></ol>",
      "css": ".ds-phases{display:flex;gap:24px;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:16px 24px}.ds-step{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--intgral-foreground-muted);font:14px/20px var(--intgral-font-sans)}.ds-marker{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:0 0 26px;width:26px;height:26px;border:1px solid var(--intgral-control-border);border-radius:50%;font-size:12px;line-height:1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-step[data-state=\"complete\"]{color:var(--intgral-foreground-secondary)}.ds-step[data-state=\"complete\"] .ds-marker{background:var(--intgral-selection);border-color:transparent}.ds-step[data-state=\"current\"]{color:var(--intgral-foreground);font-weight:500}.ds-step[data-state=\"current\"] .ds-marker{background:var(--intgral-foreground);color:var(--intgral-background);border-color:var(--intgral-foreground)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The model comes first",
    "overview": "This is the workbench's app-specific adoption of Silence 1.0.2. It records the\nexisting inspection surface after an authorized refinement. The neutral shell,\nclear type and restrained dividers keep attention on the actual model and its\nevidence. Model materials and source imagery retain their own color.\n\nThe workbench supports source intake, proposal review, decomposition, physical\nscope confirmation and explicit native conversion. Interpretation and iteration\nremain in the host conversation. This visual document complements the existing\n[architecture and limits](docs/design.md); it does not replace that document.\nThe implemented token subset is in [silence-tokens.css](web/src/silence-tokens.css),\nwith component and layout rules in [decomposition.css](web/src/decomposition.css).",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "A full-height model stage with complementary structure and inspector panels.",
      "Neutral actions and selection; semantic color accompanies written outcomes.",
      "Evidence, uncertainty, confirmation and native artifacts remain distinct.",
      "Keyboard controls, explicit focus and a native project selector.",
      "An unbranded one-row header and selection-triggered inspector; secondary evidence stays collapsed."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Content Color Rule",
        "body": "Preserve the model and source colors; keep repeated interface controls neutral and reserve semantic color for meaningful state.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Current Evidence Rule",
        "body": "A visible completion or passing report must bind to the current source, accepted program and reviewed physical scope.",
        "section": "components"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** keep the actual model and its source evidence visually primary.",
      "**Do** preserve literal requirements, units, unknowns and current scope identities.",
      "**Do** pair outcome color with written status and readable evidence.",
      "**Do** retain visible keyboard focus and native project selection."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** treat proposal approval, part confirmation and CAD completion as one state.",
      "**Don't** reuse a passing report after its revision, criteria or scope binding changes.",
      "**Don't** imply manufacturing acceptance from structural checks or valid STEP.",
      "**Don't** turn model materials, legacy one-off colors or decorative labels into UI tokens."
    ]
  }
}
